refused: d273_unbuffered_isnt_done.cy:8:14, line 8 column 14
 8 |     os::done(Give $out);
   |              ^^^^^^^^^
 what: `os::stdout.unbuffered` writes each print straight away, so there's nothing for `os::done` to finish
 why:  only a buffered writer is `must_Give`, and `os::done` is how it ends (D273)
